Volume: ~200 stores + ecommerce channel
Owner: Finance Analyst
Participants: Finance Analyst, Payment Ops Manager, FP&amp;A
Source: workflow W2791 — Payment Fee &amp; Interchange Cost Allocation to Store/Channel</bpmn:documentation>
