      <bpmn:userTask id="W2791_Task6" name="Finance Analyst allocates payment fees (MDR, e-wallet fee, BNPL fee, chargeback…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance Analyst allocates payment fees (MDR, e-wallet fee, BNPL fee, chargeback loss) to originating store/channel based on transaction-level capture data
Responsible (R): Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): FP&amp;A Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
